      "message": "The key is still the typeface id, you would need to change the key to be a hash of the SkFont (unless you really just want one per typeface).\n\nAlso, I highly doubt this is really needed. I would need some real perf numbers with and without this (and both after https://skia.googlesource.com/skia.git/+show/e85afc2b18212360b9be8e6ca8c786b4ec6348b5 ).",
