        "id": 5140
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-28T17:19:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah yes, I see. This is working around the interesting difference in where the line is drawn in SkTypeface/SkFont and hb_face/hb_font. SkTypeface bakes in the variation but hb_face does not. So the idea here is to make an hb_font which bakes in everything that is on the SkTypeface, then specialize that hb_font (as a sub-font) with whatever SkFont provides. That seems fine.",
      "parentUuid": "23f756e8_cef3e801",
      "revId": "8f0e4339386fe9722d7b268a282b1ff6da120a8a",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
